T18:33:11Z"},"body":"Should resolve #111161\r\n\r\nCurrently the `check_for_updates` has an awkward \"default\" that changes depending on whether you use stable version or not. Which means if you switch between versions, the setting might get reset or get some invalid value or whatever.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds an explicit Auto version check mode, which is also the new default.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"455\" height=\"205\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/02729b0c-5ad3-4dbe-85ce-d9df40a845a6\" />\r\n\r\nThe name changes depending on whether you use stable and it works like the current default, but if you change `check_for_updates` to e.g. Newest Stable, it will stay like that even if you use a preview version.\r\n\r\nI also replaced `get_version_info()` in EngineUpdateLabel with proper `version.h` usage.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111168/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/rep